## ACTIVE TASK

- The seller dashboard is merged on `origin/main`. The PR carried no migration,
  RPC, schema or policy change, so no Supabase deploy or remote verification was
  required or performed.
- `/vendite` is the seller dashboard. `src/app/vendite/page.tsx` keeps the
  metadata and renders the new `src/app/vendite/page-client.tsx`; derivations
  live in `src/lib/vendite/dashboard.ts` and are proven by
  `src/lib/vendite/dashboard.test.ts` with 33 cases.
- One read of the orders feeds everything. `OrderList.tsx` is split into the
  fetching `OrderList` (still used by `/acquisti`) and the presentational
  `OrderListView`; the dashboard loads `OrderService.vendite()` and
  `ListingService.mieiAnnunci()` in one `Promise.all` and hands the rows to the
  view. `sellerStatusDaOrdine` stays the single derivation.
- `ListingService.mieiAnnunci()` is the only new read: `listings` filtered by
  `.eq("seller_id", user.id)` with the existing `COLONNE_PROPRIETARIO`, ordered
  by `created_at` desc, returning `[]` without a session and on error. The
  explicit `seller_id` filter is defence in depth over `listings_select_own`;
  `seller_id` and `created_at` are both in the closed column GRANT of
  `20260729230000`. `annuncioProprietarioDaRiga()` is extracted so
  `mioAnnuncio()` and `mieiAnnunci()` map rows identically.
- Four KPI, all from real columns: annunci in `stato = 'attivo'`; orders whose
  seller status is `nuovo`, `da_preparare`, `da_spedire` or `contestato`;
  orders whose seller status is `completato`; and the sum of `prezzo_cents`
  over those completed orders. The last is labelled `Valore completate` with
  the hint `Prezzo venditore, non un incassato` — it is not an incassato, a
  payout or a balance, and a test forbids those words in the page.
- Two charts reuse `src/components/ui/chart.tsx` and the `recharts ^2.15.4`
  already in `package.json`; no library was added. One is orders per seller
  status, the other orders received per month over a six-month window.
- **Both** temporal series are bucketed by the UTC month of `created_at`, read
  from the ISO string. The gold series is therefore the share of the orders
  received in that month that is completed *today*, not the completions that
  happened in that month: no completion timestamp is readable by the client,
  because `ricezione_confermata_at` covers only explicit confirmation and stays
  null when auto-release closes the order. It is labelled `Di cui oggi
  completati`, the caption repeats it to the reader, and a test forbids the bare
  label `Completati`.
- `bun run build` compiled `recharts` and `src/components/ui/chart.tsx` for the
  first time in this repository; the dashboard is their first consumer.
  `/vendite` stays `○` (prerendered static shell).
- Home / Clubs discovery is merged as `5504dfe` on `origin/main`. PR #69
  carried no migration, so no Supabase deploy or remote verification was
  required or performed. CI read `617 test superati (soglia 617)`.
- Four files changed, two created: `frontend-next/src/app/page.tsx` reads clubs
